py></span></div></a></article><article class=\"therapy-card motion-reveal delay-3\"><a aria-label=\"Learn more about Cupping\" href=\"/Newcitywellness/services/cupping/\"><div class=\"therapy-image\"><img data-editor-image=\"cupping-card\" src=\"/Newcitywellness/images/cupping.png\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"Cupping therapy in progress\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"therapy-body\"><h3 data-editor-field=\"cupping-card-heading\">Cupping</h3><span class=\"text-link\"><builder-copy data-builder-copy=\"home-text-link-3\">Learn More <span>→</span></builder-copy></span></div></a></article><article class=\"therapy-card motion-reveal delay-4\"><a aria-label=\"Learn more about Moxibustion\" href=\"/Newcitywellness/services/moxibustion/\"><div class=\"therapy-image\"><img data-editor-image=\"moxibustion-card\" src=\"/Newcitywellness/images/moxibustion.png\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"Moxibustion warming therapy\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"therapy-body\"><h3 data-editor-field=\"moxibustion-card-heading\">Moxibustion</h3><span class=\"text-link\"><builder-copy data-builder-copy=\"home-text-link-4\">Learn More <span>→</span></builder-copy></span></div></a></article><article class=\"therapy-card motion-reveal delay-1\"><a aria-label=\"Learn more about Chinese Herbal Medicine\" href=\"/Newcitywellness/services/chinese-herbal-medicine/\"><div class=\"therapy-image\"><img data-editor-image=\"herbal-card\" src=\"/Newcitywellness/images/herbal.png\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"Natural herbs and ingredients used in Chinese herbal medicine\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"therapy-body\"><h3 data-editor-field=\"herbal-card-heading\">Chinese Herbal Medicine</h3><span class=\"text-link\"><builder-copy data-builder-copy=\"home-text-link-5\">Learn More <span>→</span></builder-copy></span></div></a></article><article class=\"therapy-card motion-reveal delay-2\"><a aria-label=\"Learn more about Gua-Sha\" href=\"/Newcitywellness/services/gua-sha/\"><div class=\"therapy-image\"><img data-editor-image=\"gua-sha-card\" src=\"/Newcitywellness/images/guasha.png\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"Traditional hands-on therapy session\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"therapy-body\"><h3 data-editor-field=\"gua-sha-card-heading\">Gua-Sha</h3><span class=\"text-link\"><builder-copy data-builder-copy=\"home-text-link-6\">Learn More <span>→</span></builder-copy></span></div></a></article><article class=\"therapy-card motion-reveal delay-3\"><a aria-label=\"Learn more about Qi-Gong\" href=\"/Newcitywellness/services/qi-gong/\"><div class=\"therapy-image\"><img data-editor-image=\"qi-gong-card\" src=\"/Newcitywellness/images/services/qi-gong/practice-640.webp\" srcset=\"/Newcitywellness/images/services/qi-gong/practice-640.webp 640w, /Newcitywellness/images/services/qi-gong/practice-1000.webp 1000w\" width=\"640\" height=\"427\" alt=\"A group practicing Tai Chi together\" sizes=\"(max-width: 900px) 50vw, (max-width: 980px) 33vw, (max-width: 1370px) 25vw, 312px\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"therapy-body\"><h3 data-editor-field=\"qi-gong-card-heading\">Qi-Gong</h3><span class=\"text-link\"><builder-copy data-builder-copy=\"home-text-link-7\">Learn More <span>→</span></builder-copy></span></div></a></article></div><div class=\"services-overview-link\"><a class=\"btn btn-outline\" href=\"/Newcitywellness/services/\"><builder-copy data-builder-copy=\"home-btn\">View All Services </builder-copy><span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div></div></section></div><div class=\"builder-section builder-native\" data-builder-section=\"first-visit\" data-builder-label=\"Your First Visit\"><section class=\"first-visit-wrap\" aria-labelledby=\"first-visit-title\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"first-visit motion-reveal\"><div class=\"first-visit-media\"><img data-editor-image=\"first-visit\" src=\"/Newcitywellness/images/first-visit.png\" width=\"1344\" height=\"768\" alt=\"Welcoming clinic interior for your first visit\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"first-visit-copy\"><span class=\"eyebrow\"><builder-copy data-builder-copy=\"home-eyebrow\">Begin Your Journey</builder-copy></span><h2 id=\"first-visit-title\" data-editor-field=\"first-visit-heading\">Your First Visit</h2><p data-editor-field=\"first-visit-copy\">What can you expect at your first session?</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/Newcitywellness/faqs/#first-session\"><builder-copy data-builder-copy=\"home-text-link-8\">Learn More </builder-copy><span><builder-copy data-builder-copy=\"home-span-2\">→</builder-copy></span></a></div></div></div></section></div><div class=\"builder-section builder-native\" data-builder-section=\"practitioner\" data-builder-label=\"Meet the Practitioner\"><section class=\"practitioner\" aria-labelledby=\"practitioner-title\"><svg class=\"practitioner-art\" viewBox=\"0 0 240 360\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M118 350C112 260 130 170 194 47M115 275C73 235 49 194 46 143M126 218C164 188 187 158 193 119M109 313C75 296 46 266 27 227M142 173C145 128 136 91 113 51\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path><path d=\"M52 145C25 127 12 98 20 73c29 6 49 28 52 58M192 121c-1-29 18-54 45-65 6 29-7 55-39 72M31 230c-23-4-40-25-42-51 25-1 45 12 55 37M114 54c-20-14-26-37-18-58 25 13 36 32 29 54M196 50c1-22 17-40 40-47 4 23-7 43-30 56\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path></svg><div class=\"container practitioner-grid\"><div class=\"practitioner-photo motion-reveal from-left\"><img data-editor-image=\"practitioner\" src=\"/Newcitywellness/images/home/practitioner-portrait.webp\" width=\"411\" height=\"410\" alt=\"Mordechai Genut, New City Acupuncture and Wellness Center practitioner\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"practitioner-copy motion-reveal from-right\"><h2 id=\"practitioner-title\" data-editor-field=\"secondary-heading\">Meet the Practitioner</h2><h3><builder-copy data-builder-copy=\"home-h3\">Mordechai Genut, MS, L.Ac.</builder-copy></h3><span hidden=\"\" data-builder-anchor=\"home-after-h3\" data-builder-anchor-section=\"practitioner\"></span><div class=\"gold-rule\"></div><p data-editor-field=\"bio-copy\">Mordechai Genut is the owner of New City Acupuncture &amp; Wellness Center. He is a licensed acupuncturist, holistic health practitioner, wellness coach, and martial arts expert. His practice is client-centered which focuses on providing care, compassion, attentiveness, and healing aimed at the whole person—mind, body, and spirit. He creates individualized treatment plans that target the specific needs of each person.</p><p data-editor-field=\"secondary-copy\">Mordechai’s goal is to help others maintain a mindful and well-balanced lifestyle to allow for optimal health, inner peace, and an overall good quality of life.</p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/Newcitywellness/about-us/\"><builder-copy data-builder-copy=\"home-btn-2\">About the Center </builder-copy><span class=\"arrow\"><builder-copy data-builder-copy=\"home-arrow-3\">→</builder-copy></span></a></div></div></section></div><div class=\"builder-section builder-native\" data-builder-section=\"conditions\" data-builder-label=\"Areas We Support\"><section class=\"conditions\" aria-labelledby=\"conditions-title\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-heading motion-reveal\"><span class=\"eyebrow\"><builder-copy data-builder-copy=\"home-eyebrow-2\">Whole-Person Care</builder-copy></span><h2 id=\"conditions-title\"><builder-copy data-builder-copy=\"home-conditions-title\">Areas We Support</builder-copy></h2><span hidden=\"\" data-builder-anchor=\"home-after-conditions-title\" data-builder-anchor-section=\"conditions\"></span><div class=\"ornament\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"ornament-line\"></span><svg class=\"ornament-mark\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2C8.5 6 6.5 10 6.5 13.5C6.5 17 8.8 19.5 12 21.5C15.2 19.5 17.5 17 17.5 13.5C17.5 10 15.5 6 12 2Z\"