s\" aria-disabled=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-left\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m15 18-6-6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><span class=\"testimonial-slider-count\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\">1<builder-copy data-builder-copy=\"testimonial-slider-testimonial-slider-count\"> / </builder-copy>3</span><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Next patient experience\" aria-controls=\"home-testimonial-cards\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></button></div><div id=\"home-testimonial-cards\" class=\"testimonial-grid\"><article class=\"testimonial-card motion-reveal from-left\"><div class=\"leaf-art\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 48 70\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 64C20 49 27 32 40 6M13 53C4 49 2 41 4 33c9 2 14 8 14 17M22 39c-2-11 3-19 13-24 2 11-2 20-13 24M28 25c-1-9 3-16 11-20 2 9-2 16-11 20M9 59C3 55-1 48 0 41\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"testimonial-copy\"><h3><builder-copy data-builder-copy=\"home-h3-2\">Hip &amp; Knee Pain</builder-copy></h3><span hidden=\"\" data-builder-anchor=\"home-after-h3-2\" data-builder-anchor-section=\"experiences\"></span><p><builder-copy data-builder-copy=\"home-p\">“Highly recommend!! Tried everything for my hip &amp; knee &amp; nothing worked. 4 years later I decided to try acupuncture. Only gone once &amp; it's relieved a lot of the stiffness in my hips &amp; pain in my knee... Wish I tried this sooner! ❤️”</builder-copy></p><span hidden=\"\" data-builder-anchor=\"home-after-p\" data-builder-anchor-section=\"experiences\"></span><div class=\"reviewer\"><builder-copy data-builder-copy=\"home-reviewer\">A. B.</builder-copy></div></div></article><article class=\"testimonial-card motion-reveal\"><div class=\"leaf-art\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 48 70\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 64C20 49 27 32 40 6M13 53C4 49 2 41 4 33c9 2 14 8 14 17M22 39c-2-11 3-19 13-24 2 11-2 20-13 24M28 25c-1-9 3-16 11-20 2 9-2 16-11 20M9 59C3 55-1 48 0 41\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"testimonial-copy\"><h3><builder-copy data-builder-copy=\"home-h3-3\">IBS &amp; Headache</builder-copy></h3><span hidden=\"\" data-builder-anchor=\"home-after-h3-3\" data-builder-anchor-section=\"experiences\"></span><p><builder-copy data-builder-copy=\"home-p-2\">“I went to New City Acupuncture for various health issues, including IBS and headaches. I was very impressed with the depth of the questions that Mordechai asked and the amount of time that he spent. I have seen a number of acupuncturists over the years, and I have great confidence in Mordechai’s knowledge and skill. I have already noticed very positive results after a few treatments.”</builder-copy></p><span hidden=\"\" data-builder-anchor=\"home-after-p-2\" data-builder-anchor-section=\"experiences\"></span><div class=\"reviewer\"><builder-copy data-builder-copy=\"home-reviewer-2\">S. B.</builder-copy></div></div></article><article class=\"testimonial-card motion-reveal from-right\"><div class=\"leaf-art\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 48 70\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 64C20 49 27 32 40 6M13 53C4 49 2 41 4 33c9 2 14 8 14 17M22 39c-2-11 3-19 13-24 2 11-2 20-13 24M28 25c-1-9 3-16 11-20 2 9-2 16-11 20M9 59C3 55-1 48 0 41\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"testimonial-copy\"><h3><builder-copy data-builder-copy=\"home-h3-4\">Anxiety &amp; Depression</builder-copy></h3><span hidden=\"\" data-builder-anchor=\"home-after-h3-4\" data-builder-anchor-section=\"experiences\"></span><p><builder-copy data-builder-copy=\"home-p-3\">“I started with Mordechai 4 weeks ago. I was severely depressed, anxious &amp; was unable to keep up with my daily routine. After just one appointment I felt a huge difference. It's now a month later &amp; I Thank God I have my life back. I'm feeling energized, positive and happy and going on a vacation I could never have taken a month ago. Mordechai is very professional with a pleasant disposition. I urge people who suffer from these symptoms to try this out. Very, very Highly recommended!!”</builder-copy></p><span hidden=\"\" data-builder-anchor=\"home-after-p-3\" data-builder-anchor-section=\"experiences\"></span><div class=\"reviewer\"><builder-copy data-builder-copy=\"home-reviewer-3\">D. G.</builder-copy></div></div></article></div><div class=\"testimonial-more\"><a href=\"/Newcitywellness/testimonials/\"><builder-copy data-builder-copy=\"home-link\">Read More Patient Testimonials </builder-copy><span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div></div></section></div><div class=\"builder-section builder-native\" data-builder-section=\"contact\" data-builder-label=\"Contact and hours\"><section class=\"contact-section\" id=\"contact\" aria-labelledby=\"contact-title\"><svg class=\"contact-art\" viewBox=\"0 0 240 360\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M118 350C112 260 130 170 194 47M115 275C73 235 49 194 46 143M126 218C164 188 187 158 193 119M109 313C75 296 46 266 27 227M142 173C145 128 136 91 113 51\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path><path d=\"M52 145C25 127 12 98 20 73c29 6 49 28 52 58M192 121c-1-29 18-54 45-65 6 29-7 55-39 72M31 230c-23-4-40-25-42-51 25-1 45 12 55 37M114 54c-20-14-26-37-18-58 25 13 36 32 29 54M196 50c1-22 17-40 40-47 4 23-7 43-30 56\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path></svg><div class=\"container contact-grid\">